PURSA QUBOOL KARLO MOULA IMAM E KAZIM. <br>
JAFFER KE GHAM MAY HAI YE DUNIYA IMAM E KAZIM.<br>
<br>
1.JAFFER KO ZEHER DEKAY UMMAT NE ZULM DHAAYA.<br>
 ZEHER E DAGHA DIYA HAI KAISA IMAM E KAZIM.....<br>
<br>
2.MANSOOR NE DIYA HAI JAFFER KO ZEHER JAB SE.<br>
 DIL KHOON HOGAYA HAI SABKA IMAM E KAZIM.....<br>
<br>
3.SHIYON KE AAJ CHEHRE MURJHAGAYE HAIN SAARE.<br>
 JAFFER KA GHAM BAPA HAI HARJA IMAM E KAZIM.....<br>
<br>
4.JAFFER KE GHAM MAY ROOLO SARWAR PA ROONE WALO.<br>
 DENGE DUAON TUMKO AAQA IMAM E KAZIM.....<br>
<br>
5.AKBAR KE MATAMI JO JAFFER KE GHAM MAY AAYE.<br>
 DETI HAI AB DUAYEIN ZEHRA IMAM E KAZIM.<br>
<br>
6.DAWAR KI YEH DUA HAI JAFFER KI QABR DEKHE.<br>
 OR JOUN BHI PADHE YE NOUHA IMAM E KAZIM.....<br>
<br>
PURSA QUBOOL KARLO MOULA IMAM E KAZIM.<br>
